sequenceDiagram
    autonumber 1 1
    participant Client
    participant Gateway
    participant Upstream

    Client->>+Gateway: GET /v1/reports
    loop Up to 4 attempts, 100ms doubling
        Gateway->>+Upstream: GET /reports
        alt 200 OK
            Upstream-->>-Gateway: 12 KiB of JSON
        else 503 Service Unavailable
            Upstream--xGateway: connection reset
            Gateway->>Gateway: sleep(backoff)
        end
    end
    break attempts exhausted
        Gateway-->>Client: 504 Gateway Timeout
    end
    Gateway-->>-Client: 200 OK
